  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Time; <strong>CL</strong> 10th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> chest; <strong>Price</strong> 8,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 2 lbs.</p>\n<p>Once per day, as a standard action, a creature wearing this threadbare vest can eject itself from time itself for 10 rounds. The creature disappears completely and cannot be the target of any damage or effect while it is vanished. When the effect ends, the creature returns to the exact spot it disappeared from (or the closest unoccupied square). From the target’s perspective no time has passed, and any effect already on the target with a duration (such as magic or poison) continues as if the time spent ejected simply had not happened. An ejected creature can attempt a new saving throw each round as a full-round action to end this effect early.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Marvelous Item, Time sphere (Eject (time)); <strong>Cost</strong> 4,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/marvelous-items#toc93\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
